{"pageid":585,"title":"Grabby Grabber","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Grabby Grabber</span>","revid":15946,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><big><i>\"Some say it grabs, others say it grabby grabs! Use this tool to grab multiple objects at once with the power of wormholes!\"</i></big>\n</p><p>The <b>Grabby Grabber</b> is a tool which can be purchased for <b>$26,000</b> at the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a>. It allows the user to project a small zone that lets them pick up multiple loose objects.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Grabby Grabber is a makeshift power gauntlet with a claw on its end, built using a makeshift construction of wood and metal. Orange lights emit from it.\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Grabby Grabber</h2>\n\n\t<div class=\"pi-image-collection wds-tabber\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li role=\"tab\" id=\"pi-tab-6a98c4de9d789-0\" class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" aria-controls=\"pi-tabpanel-6a98c4de9d789-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUnboxed\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li role=\"tab\" id=\"pi-tab-6a98c4de9d789-1\" class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" aria-controls=\"pi-tabpanel-6a98c4de9d789-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBoxed\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pi-tabpanel-6a98c4de9d789-0\" aria-labelledby=\"pi-tab-6a98c4de9d789-0\">\n\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Grabby-Grabber.png/revision/latest?cb=20240324093211\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Unboxed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Grabby-Grabber.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240324093211\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Grabby-Grabber.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240324093211 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/67/Grabby-Grabber.png/revision/latest?cb=20240324093211 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Unboxed\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Grabby-Grabber.png\" data-image-name=\"Grabby-Grabber.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pi-tabpanel-6a98c4de9d789-1\" aria-labelledby=\"pi-tab-6a98c4de9d789-1\">\n\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/83/Grabby-Grabber-BOXED.png/revision/latest?cb=20230122120900\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Boxed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/83/Grabby-Grabber-BOXED.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230122120900\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/83/Grabby-Grabber-BOXED.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230122120900 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/83/Grabby-Grabber-BOXED.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/535?cb=20230122120900 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Boxed\" width=\"270\" height=\"191\" data-image-key=\"Grabby-Grabber-BOXED.png\" data-image-name=\"Grabby-Grabber-BOXED.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$26,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Allows you to pick up multiple objects at once</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.2.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 21st, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The main purpose of the Grabby Grabber is to pick up multiple objects at once. Using the tool causes it to project a small, transparent, shimmering orb a short distance away from the player in the direction they clicked/tapped. Any item within the orb at the moment of activation will be grabbed; any objects encountered after activation will not be added to the grabber's orb, and the grabber must be reactivated to grab more/different items. The grabber's orb and any objects caught in it follow the player's point of aim. Objects retain their mass while being grabbed. One notable difference from grabbing objects normally is that they will never rotate, only staying in the orientation they were in when they were grabbed. Because of the fact that objects cannot be rotated, this frees up the SHIFT key, allowing the player to run while moving multiple objects at once.\n</p><p>The Grabby Grabber will automatically drop held objects after 12 seconds.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"6c77c7b909317453a364c68932a71e42\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Grabbygrabberusage-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Grabbygrabberusage.gif\" title=\"Grabbygrabberusage.gif (8.87 MB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/be/Grabbygrabberusage.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230722152153\" title=\"Grabbygrabberusage.gif (8.87 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"The Grabby Grabber grabbing multiple Bloxy Colas.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Grabbygrabberusage.gif\" data-image-key=\"Grabbygrabberusage.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The Grabby Grabber grabbing multiple .\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Grabbygrabberusage.gif (8.87 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"The Grabby Grabber grabbing multiple Bloxy Colas.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Grabbygrabberusage.gif\" data-image-key=\"Grabbygrabberusage.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The Grabby Grabber grabbing multiple .\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/be/Grabbygrabberusage.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230722152153\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The Grabby Grabber grabbing multiple <a href=\"/wiki/Bloxy_Cola\" title=\"Bloxy Cola\">Bloxy Colas</a>.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"A_user_flying_with_a_grabby_grabber-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:A_user_flying_with_a_grabby_grabber.gif\" title=\"A user flying with a grabby grabber.gif (4.54 MB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/7c/A_user_flying_with_a_grabby_grabber.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230726034701\" title=\"A user flying with a grabby grabber.gif (4.54 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"A player flying on a surfboard using a Grabby Grabber.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"A user flying with a grabby grabber.gif\" data-image-key=\"A_user_flying_with_a_grabby_grabber.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"A player flying on a  using a Grabby Grabber.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"A user flying with a grabby grabber.gif (4.54 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"A player flying on a surfboard using a Grabby Grabber.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"A user flying with a grabby grabber.gif\" data-image-key=\"A_user_flying_with_a_grabby_grabber.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"A player flying on a  using a Grabby Grabber.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/7c/A_user_flying_with_a_grabby_grabber.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230726034701\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">A player flying on a <a href=\"/wiki/Surfboard\" title=\"Surfboard\">surfboard</a> using a Grabby Grabber.</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Prior to the map revamp, the Grabby Grabber was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Jer%27s_Junkyard\" title=\"Jer&#39;s Junkyard\">Jer's Junkyard</a> for $22,569.</li>\n<li>The Grabby Grabber (and its <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">Grabbiest counterpart</a>) have been involved with multiple in-game tricks/exploits that allow for flight. The developers frequently have to patch tricks players use to fly.</li>\n<li>The Grabby Grabber has a dim orange light that emits from the front when held, of which no counterpart exists on the Grabbiest Grabber.</li>\n<li>Prior to a recent update, the Grabby Grabber was sold at the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a></li>\n<li>The Grabby Grabber's design seems to take inspiration form the Gravity Gun from Half-Life 2.\n<ul><li>It's upgraded counterpart, the Grabbiest Grabber also greatly resembles the Physics Gun from Gmod (which is a modified version of Half-Life 2).</li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903005246\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 81/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 83/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3615/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019481/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.721      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   29.721      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:585-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903005246 and revision id 15946. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Grabbers"],"links":[{"title":"Bloxy Cola","exists":true},{"title":"Grabbiest Grabber","exists":true},{"title":"Jer's Junkyard","exists":true},{"title":"Lighthouse","exists":true},{"title":"Surfboard","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Grabby-Grabber.png","Grabby-Grabber-BOXED.png","Grabbygrabberusage.gif","A_user_flying_with_a_grabby_grabber.gif"]}
